  "details": "Replication: \n\nAdd particle system parented to an object that can be picked up.\n\nAdd a trigger to the object (OnPickupUseDown, etc), with the action \"SetParticlePlaying\" set to Toggle. \n\nAttempt to enable the particle system.  It will work the first time to enable, then the 2nd time to disable, but it will not re-enable the particle system emission until no particles still exist. \n\nIf you set it to True on OnPickupUseDown and False on OnPickupUseUp, then it works as expected; enabling/disabling the emission as the buttons are pressed and released.",
